{%- comment -%}
  GARELON · Plazos de envío junto a la zona de compra.

  Texto editable y prudente: son estimaciones, no promesas («estimada», «aproximadamente»).
  Nunca muestra costes internos del proveedor ni afirma «entrega garantizada».
  El enlace lleva a la política de envío real (garelon-url).

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} bloque garelon_shipping (preparation, delivery, note, link_label)

  Usage:
  {% render 'garelon-shipping', block: block %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if block.settings.preparation != blank or block.settings.delivery != blank -%}
  <div class="g-ship" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    <span class="g-ship__icon">{% render 'garelon-icon', icon: 'clock' %}</span>
    <div class="g-ship__body">
      {%- if block.settings.preparation != blank -%}
        <p class="g-ship__line">{{ block.settings.preparation | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if block.settings.delivery != blank -%}
        <p class="g-ship__line">{{ block.settings.delivery | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if block.settings.note != blank or block.settings.link_label != blank -%}
        <p class="g-ship__note">
          {{- block.settings.note | escape -}}
          {%- if block.settings.link_label != blank %}
            <a class="g-ship__link" href="{% render 'garelon-url', type: 'shipping' %}">
              {{- block.settings.link_label | escape -}}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
